name 'aif-y2-ai-at-scale-postassessment-q1-2026'

wrong 'The error rate goes up as more people use the app, so it will make more mistakes per user.'
right 'The error rate stays the same, but the number of wrong answers grows with the number of users.'
wrong 'The error rate stays the same, but students are more likely to be dissatisfied with it.'
wrong 'The app will encounter more homework problems it wasn\'t trained on.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

markdown <<MARKDOWN
An AI-based homework-help app gives the wrong answer about 2 out of every 100 times. Which statement best explains why this could be a problem as the app gains more users?
MARKDOWN

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 1: Challenges at Scale
